= Ubik

 We wanted to give you a shave like no other you ever had. We said,
 It’s about time a man’s face got a little loving. We said, With Ubik’s
 -winding Swiss chromium never-ending blade, the days of
 scrape-scrape are over. So try Ubik. And be loved. Warning: use
 only as directed. And with caution

- @purchase: Buy Ubik.
- @root: Do nothing.

